WEBVTT

NOTE These are descriptive action captions for a silent screen recording.

1
00:00.000 --> 00:07.250
In Club admin view, open Teams
under Squad tools.

2
00:07.250 --> 00:09.000
Under Manage teams,
choose Add another team.

3
00:09.000 --> 00:16.700
Enter a team name,
then select Create team.

4
00:16.700 --> 00:20.900
Wait for the Team created confirmation.

5
00:20.900 --> 00:31.400
Under Invite Coaches with team access,
enter the coach's email address.

6
00:31.400 --> 00:34.000
Set Role to Team Admin.

7
00:34.000 --> 00:37.500
Choose the new team
in Team access.

8
00:37.500 --> 00:42.300
Select Send Coach invite
and wait for confirmation.

9
00:42.300 --> 00:46.400
Coach invite sent.
Access stays pending until the recipient accepts.
